    "answer": {
      "short": "$4\\left(x-\\frac52\\right)^2-24$\n\nFactor out $4$, then complete the square inside the brackets.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}4x^2-20x+1&=4\\left(x^2-5x+\\frac14\\right)\\\\4x^2-20x+1&=4\\left(\\left(x-\\frac52\\right)^2-\\frac{25}{4}+\\frac14\\right)\\\\4x^2-20x+1&=4\\left(x-\\frac52\\right)^2-24.\\end{align*}$$",
